        "contenuto_esteso": "(Adnkronos) - HILLSBORO, Ore. and KAOHSIUNG, March 18, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Semiconductor equipment supplier E&R Engineering Corp. (8027.TW) today announced its new office in Hillsboro, Portland. Following the establishment of its Phoenix, Arizona site, this second North American hub marks a milestone in providing localized support within the U.S. semiconductor ecosystem."
